      "values:originalText": "(4) The surcharge information notice must specify:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2016A00009\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Payment Surcharges) Act\nNo. 9, 2016\n\n(a) the kinds of information or documents to be given to the\nCommission; and\n\n(b) the period for giving the information or documents."
    },
