      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-payment-surcharges-act-2016.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The infringement notice does not have any effect if the notice:\n\n(a) is issued more than 12 months after the day that the\ncontravention of section 55B is alleged to have occurred; or\n\n(b) relates to more than one alleged contravention of section 55B\nby the person.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The infringement notice does not have any effect if the notice:\n\n(a) is issued more than 12 months after the day that the\ncontravention of section 55B is alleged to have occurred; or\n\n(b) relates to more than one alleged contravention of section 55B\nby the person.",
